  {
   "id": 3,
   "ref": "540–543",
   "en": "But [even if I wanted to|4,5] — who would let me? Who would take a woman they despise aboard their proud ships? Don't you understand, you fool, ruined as you are — don't you see yet the treachery bred in that Trojan blood? What then? Should I run off alone, and join their crews as they sail away rejoicing?",
